    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "my-your",
        "title": "“My” tekikyuka",
        "body": [
          "Mu Luganda ekigambo “wange” kikyuka okusinziira ku linnya: maama **wange**, ekitabo **kyange**, ebitabo **byange**. Mu Lungereza **my** kye kimu bulijjo: **my mother**, **my book**, **my books**.",
          "Era **my** kijja **mu maaso** g’erinnya, si mabega: “Maama wange” = **My mother**."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "plurals",
        "title": "Okufuula ebingi",
        "body": [
          "Mu Luganda entandikwa y’erinnya ekyuka: **ekitabo**, **ebitabo**. Mu Lungereza ebisinga byongerako **-s** ku nkomerero: **book**, **books**; **cup**, **cups**.",
          "Ebimu tebigoberera nkola, era byetaaga okukwatibwa mu mutwe:"
        ],
        "table": [
          ["Omu", "Bangi", "Luganda"],
          ["man", "men", "omusajja, abasajja"],
          ["woman", "women", "omukazi, abakazi"],
          ["child", "children", "omwana, abaana"],
          ["person", "people", "omuntu, abantu"]
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "a-the",
        "title": "“A” ne “the”",
        "body": [
          "Oluganda terulina bigambo bino. Mu Lungereza **a** kiteekebwa mu maaso g’ekintu ekimu ekitamanyiddwa: **a book** (ekitabo kimu). **The** kiteekebwa ku kintu ekimanyiddwa: **the book** (ekitabo ekyo).",
          "Ebintu ebitabalika, nga **water**, **food** ne **tea**, tebiteekebwako **a**: **I want water.**"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Jjajja",
        "body": [
          "Mu Lungereza **grandmother** ye jjajja omukazi, ate **grandfather** jjajja omusajja. Abaana batera okugamba **Grandma** ne **Grandpa**. Mu Uganda, era bangi bagamba “Jjajja” nga boogera Olungereza."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "stories": [
    {
      "id": "market-matooke",
      "title": "Matooke mu katale",
      "unlockAfter": "u2s3l1",
      "cast": ["emma", "mukasa"],
      "summary": "Emma agula matooke ow’eky’eggulo.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "How are you, sir?",
            "base": "Oli otya, ssebo?"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "mukasa",
            "target": "I’m fine, madam. What do you want?",
            "base": "Gyendi, nnyabo. Oyagala ki?"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "I want matooke.",
            "base": "Njagala matooke."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Emma ayagala ki?",
          "options": ["Caayi", "Matooke", "Ekitabo"],
          "answer": 1
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "mukasa",
            "target": "Okay. Five thousand shillings.",
            "base": "Kale. Ssente nkumi ttaano."
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Matooke ssente mmeka?",
          "options": ["Nkumi bbiri", "Nkumi ttaano", "Omutwalo"],
          "answer": 1
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "Okay. I want water too.",
            "base": "Kale. Njagala n’amazzi."
          }
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "mukasa",
            "target": "Here is the water. Thank you very much, madam!",
            "base": "Gano amazzi. Weebale nnyo, nnyabo!"
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "Emma agula ki ekirala?",
          "options": ["Amazzi", "Caayi", "Emmere ya Jjajja"],
          "answer": 0
        },
        {
          "line": {
            "speaker": "emma",
            "target": "Thank you, sir. Goodbye!",
            "base": "Weebale, ssebo. Weraba!"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
